      "mergeID": "62fd74ca506b5244c832dd15",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Often when I'm looking at my radial menu I'm looking down at it. Spawning the personal mirror then makes it appear so you're looking straight at it the moment you toggle it on. If you're looking down, spawn it, then look up, you're then looking at the mirror at a weird downward 45 degree angle instead of in vertically straight in front of you.\nAlso the default location seems way too claustrophobic, should be a little further away.",
