      "value": "@{627e94e69bf04e1ede28a21b|full_name}: Well I mean I never really reported this as a bug but rather as a feature request. I still think this would be nice to have as currently positioning it at for example a 90° angle is not that easy to do (at least if you want it to be peferct). \nAlso currently when moving the mirror far away, turning it off  and later back on will spawn it at the same distance as you left it. This often ended in me bing confused where my mirror is because it's behind some random wall.\nI'm confused why this was makred as \"not a bug\", even though it never was a bug report.",
