  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-30T14:16:26.021Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nRight now, in Desktop the mirror spawns where you are looking, but in VR it always spawn straight on the floor. I think allowing us to control this behaviour would be great.\n# Suggestion:\nAdd a Sub Menu that allows us to control the spawn position when turning the mirror back on. It could be called `Spawn Behaviour`. \nHere are some options I think might be good:\n1. `View` always spawning the mirror depended on where you are looking. (Tilting it based on that, also how it currently works in desktop)\n2. `Vertical` always spawning straight on the floor.\n3. `Last Position` always spawning it where you last left it (could have problems when switching worlds)\n4. `45°` I’ve heard from a lot of people that they would like it to spawn at a 45° angle, so why not.",
